{
  "id": "PRO.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Egetabu ki’Emebeyano 4",
  "copyright": "© 2021 KENBS",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ayakonyorekana korwa ase Obong’aini",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe abana bane, igwa amorokererio ane inche iso; tegerera mono, erinde monyaare koba n’okomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nigo ’nkobaa amorokererio amaya; timotiga aya nabachiikeire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo narenge omwana, narenge na tata; nigo narenge omwororo nanchire na baba, ekiagera nigo narenge omomoima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tata akanyorokereria, aganteebia, “Tiga amang’ana ane abeere ase enkoro yao ime; orende amachiiko ane, erio nario or’abe moyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyorere obong’aini na okomanya, tobaisa kobieba! Tibwanga koigwera amang’ana ’ngokwana korwa ase omonwa one.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa gotiga obong’aini, ekiagera borobwo ’mbokorende. Obwanche, na borobwo ’mbogere ogeenderere koba buya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obong’aini nigo bore obw’engeencho enene. Ase ayio, enyorere obong’aini, na kende gionsi okorigia, rigia obe n’okomanya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obobare koba n’engeencho enene, na borobwo ’mbogokinie; koraboboanie nigo borakorentere ogosikwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbobeke ase omotwe oo ekiore gechabeire, naende bokoe eguutwa y’obonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omwana one, igwa amang’ana ane, oyaanche, igo nario emiaka y’obogima bwao er’abe emenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche nakworokereirie enchera y’obong’aini; nakoraaire ase oboeto bore oboronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero oraabe kogotaara, togotererigwa, na ekero oraabe gokominyoka, tokogoochwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwata amorokererio bokong’u, toyatiga arue ase ore; yarende, ekiagera n’aro obogima bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tobaisa kobwatia enchera y’abakori amabe, gose tobwatia chiinchera chi’abaanto ababe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bweatanane korwa ase enchera eyio, toyebwatia, korende ogobere oetere ensemo, ogeende bosio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto abwo tibari korara goika barore ng’a bakorire amabe. Onye tibarakorera omonto amabe, tibari korara chitoro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endagera yabo bakoria n’ogokora amabe, na edivai yabo bakonywa n’obotindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende enchera y’abanyene oboronge nigo enga buna amasase a mambia; ayio akogeenderera koraba goetania goika bwakia se.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enchera y’abakori amabe nigo enga buna omosunte ekerima; tibari komanya ebinto bikobagocha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwana one, tegerera oigwe amang’ana ane! Igwera amang’ana ’nkogoteebia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amang’ana ayio tabaisa korua ase amaiso ao. Yagache ime ase enkoro yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio nigo are obogima ase oyio oyanyorire, naende nigo akogwenia omobere oye bwonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Renda enkoro yao kobua ande onsi orendete, ekiagera nao chinsoko chi’obogima chikorua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuguta chinkwana chi’obokorekanu korwa ase omonwa oo, na amang’ana y’obong’ainereria korwa ase ebikoba biao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiga amaiso ao arigererie gochia bosio, na ebioge bi’amaiso ao biramokigwe boronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rongeyia oboeto bw’amagoro ao, ne chiinchera chiao chionsi chibe chindonge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Togobera gochia aande, ensemo y’okorio gose ey’okobee. Rusia okogoro kwao korwa ase ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.4.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.5",
    "number": "5",
